WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.220
The Red Hair Pirates are some of the most
mysterious and powerful characters in One

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:05.220
Piece.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:09.130
And as Shanks is joining the race to become
pirate king, we are finally learning a ton

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.910
of new stuff about his origins and true powers.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.840
So here is the complete story of Shanks and
his crew.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.180
Starting with Shanks’ hometown.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:22.560
In chapter 434, we learn that Shanks was born
in a town somewhere in the west blue.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.279
The only random fact that we have about this
place, is that it makes fine wine.

00:00:27.279 --> 00:00:28.279
Okay.

00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:33.489
However, he did not stay there for long as
only one year after Shanks’ birth, the former

00:00:33.489 --> 00:00:40.059
pirate king Gol D. Roger found him in a treasure
chest after his legendary battle on God Valley

00:00:40.059 --> 00:00:42.100
with the pirate Rocks D. Xebec.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:47.219
In Film Red, which actually dropped a lot
of new canon information about all the Red

00:00:47.219 --> 00:00:52.899
Hair Pirates, it is heavily hinted that Shanks
is from the Figarland family, which we only

00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:58.399
know because it was specifically mentioned
by the leaders of the world government during

00:00:58.399 --> 00:00:59.399
Film Red.

00:00:59.399 --> 00:01:02.750
And while we know nothing else about this
mysterious family, the fact that they are

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:08.049
specifically mentioned by the Five Elders
here, means that the Figarland are very likely

00:01:08.049 --> 00:01:11.049
a family of celestial dragons.

00:01:11.049 --> 00:01:16.729
This makes sense, because we know there were
Celestial Dragons present on God Valley during

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:19.049
the battle between Roger and the former pirate
Rocks D. Xebec.

00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:24.020
And it would also explain, why Shanks is able
to get a private audition with the Gorosei

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.020
[ch 907].

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:29.190
But regardless of his true family, little
baby Shanks is now a part of the crew of the

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:30.509
first pirate king.

00:01:30.509 --> 00:01:34.970
And he, along with his childhood friend Buggy
the Clown, become apprentice pirates on the

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:38.110
crew at a very young age.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.990
Before the age of nine, Roger already gave
Shanks the straw hat [ch 964] and by the time

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:48.329
Shanks is twelve, he is fighting alongside
the rest of the crew, as we see in their clashes

00:01:48.329 --> 00:01:52.540
against Roger’s former rival Shiki [ch 0]
or against a young Whitebeard [9654].

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:56.820
Not exactly the greatest parenting in the
world.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:02:01.880
Shanks is thirteen during that battle with
Whitebeard’s crew and it was here that Shanks’

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.380
fated rivalry with Blackbeard begins.

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:10.110
After the battle, Shanks and Buggy note that
the young Blackbeard appears not to sleep,

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:15.720
and while Shanks initially thinks that sounds
like fun, their rivalry will come to shape

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:19.000
the future of the One Piece world.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.250
But speaking of Buggy, these two have a particularly
long history and friendship.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.780
They fought many battles together with Roger’s
crew [chapter 0 strong world, 434, 966].

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:30.220
Shanks was the one who hilariously caused
Buggy to accidentally eat his devil fruit

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:31.220
[ch 19].

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:35.550
And Shanks even stayed behind with a sick
Buggy when Roger and the rest of the crew

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.629
finally reached Laugh Tale [ch 967].

00:02:37.629 --> 00:02:42.230
They cried together [ch 968] after Roger disbanded
the crew when Shanks was fourteen.

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:46.861
And while these friends eventually separated
after Roger’s execution [ch 434], Shanks

00:02:46.861 --> 00:02:51.770
still knows how to get under Buggy’s skin,
as we see in Marineford [ch 580] when he tricks

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:55.010
Buggy with a promise of fake treasure.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:03:00.580
This rivalry is bound to continue in the current
story because by some strange twist of fate,

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.430
they are both currently Emperor’s of the
Sea.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:08.019
So after Roger’s death, we now move beyond
Shanks’ time with Roger.

00:03:08.019 --> 00:03:13.209
At the age of seventeen, he sets out to find
a crew and become a great captain himself.

00:03:13.209 --> 00:03:18.860
It is well known that during his younger days,
Shanks had legendary duels with the strongest

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.810
swordsman in the world, Dracule Mihawk.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:26.489
According to Whitebeard, these duels were
such powerful clashes that they left the world

00:03:26.489 --> 00:03:29.549
desperate to know who had won each fight.

00:03:29.549 --> 00:03:32.780
However, now these two have a very curious
relationship.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:39.250
They were obviously fierce rivals, but after
Shanks lost his arm, Mihawk refused to fight

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:40.250
him.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:45.310
He seems to regret that his most challenging
rival can no longer use his strongest sword

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.310
arm.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:51.140
Despite this, Mihawk still shows Shanks tremendous
respect as refuses to fight against him on

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.140
in the war at Marineford.

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.140
[ch 580].

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:58.159
Even further, Mihawk is the one who brought
Luffy’s first bounty to Shanks in chapter

00:03:58.159 --> 00:04:04.959
96 so it’s likely that he holds Shanks’
Vivre card, as how else would he find the

00:04:04.959 --> 00:04:06.760
elusive Red-Hair pirates.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:11.760
So it looks like Shanks and Mihawk have become
close friends over time.

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:17.459
And even though both Mihawk and Buggy declined
joining the Red-Hair pirates, Shanks did gather

00:04:17.459 --> 00:04:23.880
a truly impressive crew after Roger’s execution,
most of which appear in the very first chapter

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:24.880
of the story.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:29.460
This core group of members are known as the
Red Hair pirate executives:

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:34.650
Starting with Benn Beckmann, the vice-captain
who surprisingly is a serious womanizer, a

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:39.380
gun specialist, and the smartest character
from the entire east blue.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.830
Similar to Rayleigh or Zoro, it is said that
he is not too far away in power from his captain.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:48.770
He is even strong enough to make an admiral
like Kizaru [ch 579] hesitate and it is also

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:52.509
suggested that he is the one who took the
arm from Eustass Kid.

00:04:52.509 --> 00:04:57.340
Next, quite unsurprisingly, Lucky Roux is
the Red-Hair pirates cook, because we fittingly

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:00.710
almost never see him without a slab of meat
or a drink.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:06.120
This fun loving mountain of a man fights with
a gun and also by rolling his massive body

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.800
into a ball to smash into opponents.

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:14.470
Interestingly, he is also the first person
to kill somebody in the story, aside from

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:16.210
Roger’s executioners.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:21.280
Along with Beckman and Lucky Roux, Usopp’s
long lost father Yasopp always appears whenever

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.970
Shanks shows up.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:26.729
And much of what we love about Usopp is also
shared by his father.

00:05:26.729 --> 00:05:31.740
They are both jokers who love to encourage
the crew to have fun, although Yasopp is sweating

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:35.340
about meeting his son after abandoning him
all those years ago.

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:40.870
Naturally, Yasopp is a god level sniper, and
Shanks recruited him specifically because

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.800
it is said he never misses his target.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:47.840
And while we know much less about the rest
of the crew, we did learn a little more about

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:52.510
the main officers from the booklet handed
out alongside the movie Film Red.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:57.960
For example, Limejuice here apparently fights
with this staff charged with electricity and

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.940
likes to jump around in the air, similar to
Sanji.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:05.889
With his electric theme, he could possibly
clash with Nami one day.

00:06:05.889 --> 00:06:10.970
Next we have the duo Bonkpunch and Monster,
who are each listed as officers even though

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.940
they fight as a team.

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:18.009
The pair are the musicians of the crew, and
possibly even inspired Luffy to have a musician

00:06:18.009 --> 00:06:19.669
on his own crew.

00:06:19.669 --> 00:06:24.110
Bonkpunch fights by charging up devastating
punches, while Monster takes care of the weaker

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.460
enemies who try to stop his partner.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:32.050
Next, Building Snake is the Navigator of the
crew, and just like Nami he sports some serious

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.050
ink.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:36.990
He fights with two swords that he apparently
juggles in the air, and he also has a signature

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:40.169
stomp kick that he uses to finish enemies.

00:06:40.169 --> 00:06:43.479
And now we have Hongo, the doctor of the Red-Hair
pirates.

00:06:43.479 --> 00:06:50.150
While all of the crew love to party, he seems
to be one of the more serious members.

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:54.660
After wano [ch 1054], he reminded Shanks that
Luffy’s ally Bartolomeo was causing problems

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.120
in Shanks’ territory.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:00.860
This reminder convinced Shanks to avoid meeting
Luffy just yet.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:05.490
Naturally, Hongo has incredible knowledge
of medicine but is surprisingly knowledgeable

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:10.060
about weapons, as he is said to be able to
take apart any weapon instantly.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:15.390
And while Howling Gab is ferocious to look
at, he apparently has a kind personality and

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:17.810
is even timid when not in battle.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:22.060
However, when he does fight, he uses this
super powered roar blast to wreck enemies

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.060
from a distance.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:27.509
I can only imagine him and Franky shooting
blasts at each other from a distance.

00:07:27.509 --> 00:07:32.110
We are also told that he can use paralysis
to take out opponents.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.330
Finally, we have Rockstar.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:38.379
And while he has only joined the Red-Hair
Pirates more recently, he seems to be a trusted

00:07:38.379 --> 00:07:42.009
messenger who is tasked with communicating
with other pirate captains.

00:07:42.009 --> 00:07:47.940
He is a prideful man who fights with a sword
and seems to be able to use it like a drill.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:53.110
We can also assume they are ridiculously strong
with the ability to use both Armament and

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:58.550
Observation Haki, as even the marines acknowledge
that the Red Hair pirates are an equally balanced

00:07:58.550 --> 00:07:59.550
fighting force.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:03.440
Although, we have never seen any of them use
devil fruits.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:08.460
Which makes me wonder, do they just really
love to swim or could it be that Shanks knows

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:14.090
a secret condition of getting to Laugh Tale
that requires not having a devil fruit?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:17.780
What ever the answer is, the Red Hair pirates
are truly a powerhouse crew, and keep watching

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:20.879
because you don’t want to miss everything
we know about Shanks’ ridiculous powers

00:08:20.879 --> 00:08:22.040
later in the video.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:26.440
However, there is one other member of Shanks’
family we have yet to discuss.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:30.159
When Shanks is twenty years old, he finds
a baby girl in a treasure chest.

00:08:30.159 --> 00:08:31.419
This is Uta.

00:08:31.419 --> 00:08:38.500
And while this is shown to us in Film Red
and we don’t know if the events of of the

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:46.700
movie are part of the canon story, Uta appeared
in a single panel in chapter 1055 [ch 1055

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:51.310
next to baby Luffy, Momo, and Hiyori] which
makes her backstory canon.

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:57.000
So maybe because Shanks was adopted in the
same way, he takes in Uta as part of his crew.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:01.040
Uta grew up with the Red Hair pirates and
also befriended a young Luffy, with the two

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:06.370
forming a fierce rivalry and friendship when
Shanks visited the Goa Kingdom.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:11.329
And while Uta displayed her devil fruit in
Film Red, none of the other Red Hair pirate

00:09:11.329 --> 00:09:13.370
officers have their own devil fruits.

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:17.090
However, they did have an interest in one
particular fruit.

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:21.300
Right before we meet them in chapter one,
they had just stolen the mythical Sun God

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.970
Nika fruit from a government ship [ch 1018].

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:28.940
What is unclear is if Shanks knew the true
powers of this fruit and its awakened form,

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.680
or if he just stole it by random chance.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:35.940
But come on, do we really believe that it
was random?

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:40.060
If this was intentional, then was he trying
to find the next Joy Boy?

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:44.209
And if so, who did he have in mind to eat
the fruit?

00:09:44.209 --> 00:09:49.580
These questions make me wonder what exactly
Roger’s last words to Shanks were that made

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.110
him cry so much&nbsp; [ch 968].

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:55.190
Could he have told Shanks to find this fruit
and to guide the next Joy Boy to find the

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.649
One Piece.

00:09:56.649 --> 00:09:58.149
It is certainly possible.

00:09:58.149 --> 00:10:04.780
Especially because many former Roger pirates
were scattered along the path to Laugh Tale,

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:08.180
seemingly ready to help Luffy when the time
arrived.

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:12.870
But again, we have to ask, was this really
to help Luffy?

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:17.240
Or does Shanks have his own motivations for
wanting Luffy to succeed?

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:21.500
And all of that happened to Shanks before
we even started chapter 1.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:26.149
It is at the start of the story when we first
meet a twenty-seven year old Shanks and the

00:10:26.149 --> 00:10:28.970
crew in the Goa kingdom.

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:31.800
Here Shanks inspires Luffy to become the pirate
king.

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:37.149
He even sacrifices his arm to protect Luffy
and gives him the straw hat before he leaves

00:10:37.149 --> 00:10:38.149
the island.

00:10:38.149 --> 00:10:43.269
We’ve only recently learned that Shanks
already had a bounty of 1.04 billion berries

00:10:43.269 --> 00:10:44.450
in chapter one.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:50.300
An insane amount that tells us Shanks was
already a world famous pirate just twelve

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:53.230
years after Roger’s execution.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:57.899
Unfortunately, after this chapter we barely
ever get to see Shanks in action.

00:10:57.899 --> 00:11:05.340
Ten years later in chapter 96, Shanks is thirty-seven
years old and we see him throw a party after

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:08.110
Mihawk brings him Luffy’s first bounty poster.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:13.620
Next we see him twice try to warn Whitebeard
about Blackbeard, once via messenger and once

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:14.620
in person.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:19.460
When the two Emperors meet, both Shanks and
Whitebeard talk about scars that ache because

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:23.339
of Blackbeard, hinting at his importance for
the future.

00:11:23.339 --> 00:11:28.500
This is also the first time we hear about
haki and see what the power of conqueror’s

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.030
haki can do [show crew passing out, sky splitting
in chapter 434].

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:34.930
But this is nothing compared to Shanks’
biggest haki feat that we will discuss later

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:36.259
in the video [animation of shanks radiating
haki].

00:11:36.259 --> 00:11:41.760
And while all those examples are brief, Shanks
first major involvement after chapter 1 comes

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:44.279
during the war at Marineford.

00:11:44.279 --> 00:11:49.950
First he stops the strongest creature in the
sea, Kaido, from coming to the battle and

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.382
then Shanks does this [Shanks stopping Akainu].

00:11:52.382 --> 00:11:56.470
Stopping the rampaging Akainu who even Whitebeard
couldn’t keep down.

00:11:56.470 --> 00:12:01.850
With Shanks’ arrival, the war at Marineford
ends, as not even Blackbeard or the fleet

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:05.079
admiral Sengoku are willing to fight the Red-Hair
pirate crew.

00:12:05.079 --> 00:12:11.510
In fact, we learn that Shanks has earned great
respect from Sengoku, something no other pirate

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:13.209
has done since Whitebeard.

00:12:13.209 --> 00:12:19.810
And man does he deserve it, as we see he respectfully
buries both Ace and Whitebeard after the war.

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:24.190
He’s not just a badass, but he’s a classy
dude as well.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:28.060
Now if you are an anime only watcher, you
might not know that it is possible that Shanks

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:33.380
is married AND has a kid, and no I’m not
talking about Uta.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:37.701
While this isn’t confirmed, there are a
few cover pages from the manga [615, 806,

00:12:37.701 --> 00:12:43.250
838] that show Shanks at a wedding, and Makino,
this barkeeper from chapter 1 who Shanks was

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:46.130
fond of, with a wedding ring and a baby.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:51.199
If this is true, it seems that Shanks has
been doing a lot more than just sitting around

00:12:51.199 --> 00:12:53.590
drinking booze, if you know what I mean.

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:58.480
After Marineford, we don’t see him again
in the main story until chapter 903 when he

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:02.180
is reacting to Luffy’s bounty after Whole
Cake Island.

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:06.889
During this appearance, the now thirty-nine
year old Shanks claims that Luffy is still

00:13:06.889 --> 00:13:11.580
not ready to meet with him, which makes me
think that he is waiting for Luffy to awaken

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.610
the Nika fruit and become Joy Boy.

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:19.350
Just another clue that he really did know
what the fruit was when he stole it.

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:23.240
Fortunately, we don’t have to wait long
until his next appearance.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:29.690
We see him again just four chapters [ch 907]
later doing something NO ONE expected.

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:34.450
Having a private conversation with the Gorosei
themselves.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:39.089
In a scene that is still unexplained, Shanks
wants to discuss a certain pirate with the

00:13:39.089 --> 00:13:45.350
Five Elders, who are for some reason completely
comfortable being in the same room with Shanks.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:51.769
While we don’t know who he wants to discuss,
it is likely either Blackbeard or Luffy, and

00:13:51.769 --> 00:13:57.300
it makes me wonder if he was warning them
that Luffy could soon awaken his devil fruit.

00:13:57.300 --> 00:14:01.360
Now you might be thinking, why would Shanks
tell them this?

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:06.240
But there is just so much we don’t know
about Shanks’ past and his motivations.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:11.430
Remember Shanks likely comes from the Figarland
family, who could be Celestial dragons.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:15.290
This could explain how he is able to meet
with the Gorosei.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.529
And if that wasn’t strange enough, in the
very next chapter the Gorosei are discussing

00:14:19.529 --> 00:14:22.759
a great cleansing for the world.

00:14:22.759 --> 00:14:26.029
What did Shanks tell them that led them to
that conclusion?

00:14:26.029 --> 00:14:27.029
*blows air*…

00:14:27.029 --> 00:14:29.110
So many questions from this one scene.

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:32.170
And things get even more interesting after
Wano.

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:36.920
During the festivities following the victory,
Shanks arrives and chases away the forest

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:42.911
logia fruit user admiral Greenbull with a
conqueror’s haki blast from miles away [ch

00:14:42.911 --> 00:14:43.911
1054, 1055].

00:14:43.911 --> 00:14:50.079
A truly unthinkable feat which shows us just
how ridiculously strong the Yonko is.

00:14:50.079 --> 00:14:54.610
Yet, this appearance means so much more for
the story because it finally seems like Shanks

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:57.880
is ready to acknowledge Luffy as a great pirate.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:02.550
And while he doesn’t want to meet Luffy
yet, after he sees Luffy’s awakened form

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:08.160
on a bounty poster, he decides it is now time
to go claim the One Piece for himself.

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:14.170
In fact, in chapter 1076, we see Shanks in
Elbaf, the land of giants, about to confront

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:15.639
Luffy’s rival Eustass Kid.

00:15:15.639 --> 00:15:17.527
Now what you have to remember is that to find
the One Piece you have to reach Laugh Tale.

00:15:17.527 --> 00:15:21.339
And to do that, you need the four Road Poneglyphs
which unbreakable stones created during the

00:15:21.339 --> 00:15:22.990
void century.

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:28.519
The three that we know of are in Zou, Wano,
and Whole Cake Island – all of which Luffy

00:15:28.519 --> 00:15:35.600
already has found – and it is widely believed
that the missing one is in Elbaf, exactly

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:38.330
where we currently find Shanks.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.050
So if Shanks wants to find the One Piece,
he can either sail around and find the Road

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:49.410
Poneglyphs himself or, in typical pirate fashion,
he can steal the two that Kid has from Wano

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:55.030
and Whole Cake Island, leaving him with just
one more to find if he already has the one

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:56.030
in Elbaf.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:16:01.560
Assuming, of course, that he has someone who
can read them, or he can kidnap someone who

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:02.560
can [ominous music showing Robin].

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:06.060
But we have to ask, why is Shanks only doing
this now?

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:10.130
If he really wanted to, he should have known
where at least three of the Poneglyphs were

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:14.970
and collected them years ago because he found
them all when sailing with Roger.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:20.000
So was Shanks waiting because he needed Luffy
to awaken his fruit and become Joy Boy?

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:25.620
We don’t know, but there are at least three
possibilities for Shanks’ future.

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:30.550
First, he could be guiding Luffy to the One
Piece so that Luffy can change the world for

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:31.550
the better.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:36.010
This is the *Shanks is a good guy* version
and how many of us have viewed him for the

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:37.540
entire story.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:43.910
There’s also the *Shanks is a villain* theory,
which has a lot of evidence such as his meeting

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:44.920
with the Gorosei.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:49.699
It is possible that Shanks has been working
with the Gorosei or Imu all along as they

00:16:49.699 --> 00:16:53.360
try to erase the threat of Joy Boy and the
One Piece forever.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:58.910
However, the third possibility is that Shanks
is just using Luffy for his own goals.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:03.389
As we’ve already described, Shanks is only
acting now that Joy Boy has awakened.

00:17:03.389 --> 00:17:08.640
So it's possible this is a requirement to
use the One Piece, and now that Joy Boy is

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.339
here, Shanks is moving forward with his own
plans.

00:17:11.339 --> 00:17:17.410
And if that is the case, then the Red-Hair
pirates could be a huge obstacle for the Straw

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:18.610
hats to&nbsp; overcome.

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:27.460
You see, Shanks is undeniably powerful, with
a bounty of over 4 billion berries.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:32.770
Even Kaido considered Shanks to be one of
the few who could actually fight him.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:37.500
We know Shanks fights with one of the Supreme
Grade blades and has the strongest haki feats

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.380
in the story so far.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:44.500
He is even known as the killer of observation
haki, blocking out future-sight users like

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.640
Luffy and Katakuri.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:50.559
We also recently learned that he commands
a large fleet of strong pirates, just like

00:17:50.559 --> 00:17:51.760
Whitebeard did.

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:56.539
Aside from his fleet, he has numerous strong
allies all around the world.

00:17:56.539 --> 00:18:01.000
Including, it seems, the giants of Elbaf,
who are said to be the strongest fighting

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.120
force in the world.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:08.679
So when the time comes for Luffy to meet Shanks,
it could be a joyous reunion with lots of

00:18:08.679 --> 00:18:15.880
food and drinks, or it could also be a terrible
battle and Luffy’s most difficult test yet.

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:19.990
But let’s assume that Shanks is the good
guy and he truly wants to help Luffy find

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:20.990
the One Piece.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:26.299
If this is true, it brings up a really interesting
question that takes us all the way back to

00:18:26.299 --> 00:18:27.299
chapter one.

00:18:27.299 --> 00:18:29.740
Why didn’t Shanks let Luffy join his crew?

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:34.549
Surely, the Red Hair pirates could have taught
Luffy so much and helped him uncover the secrets

00:18:34.549 --> 00:18:35.960
of his legendary devil fruit.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:40.789
Well if you want to know all about what might
have happened if Luffy joined Shanks’ Crew,

00:18:40.789 --> 00:18:43.740
you can watch this video right here.

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:44.450
Shanks for watching.

